## What's Next

The roadmap (v3.5 → v4.0):

- Backtest engine (validate signals against historical PRICE_HISTORY)
- Sector rotation dashboard (11 S&P sectors, top 3 / bottom 3 daily)
- Owl surveillance (volume pressure + cycle sync + pack divergence alerts)
- Universal ticker search (any US stock via Alpaca)
- Add-to-radar write-back (Google Apps Script webhook)
- Confidence intervals on Markov probabilities
- Statistical significance testing on Fourier cycles

